<title>USA: National Energy Group 1997 cap spend up.</title>
<headline>National Energy Group 1997 cap spend up.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil and gas company National Energy Group Inc said Thursday it had set aside $57 million for capital spending for 1997, 137 percent more than the $24 million it spent the previous year.</p>
<p>The company, which explores and produces the fuels, said it would use the money to drill 98 wells.</p>
<p>&quot;The budget includes $45 million to drill 85 development wells and $12 million for 13 exploration wells,&quot; it said.</p>
